じゃあ、呼ぼうかな、風真の訓練道具、どどーる？道具？道具？行くぞ！
Now, shall I call them? Kazama's training equipment—do-doru? Equipment! Here we go!

185
00:21:55,383 --> 00:21:59,913
それでは、3、2、1、お願いします！
Now then, 3, 2, 1, please!

186
00:22:00,253 --> 00:22:04,313
うわあ！目の前来た！
Whoa! It came right in front of me!

187
